    "homeType": "MULTI_FAMILY",
    "description": "This 1905 Victorian in Noe Valley blends historic\ncharm with modern comfort. Located in the heart of 24th\nStreets lively corridor, this multi unit residence offers a\nflexible layout with lots of possibilities.\nUnit 4214 (vacant) features high ceilings, 3 bright bedrooms,\n1 bath, and a formal sitting area with a decorative fireplace.\nThe front double parlor can serve as two bedrooms or a\nbedroom and office, while the sunlit kitchen flows to a\npantry/laundry area and beautiful shared backyard, ideal for\nentertaining.\nThe lower level, unit 4216 (tenant occupied) with its own\nentrance, includes 2 bedrooms for multi-generational living,\nhome office, or rental income, complete with a full bath,\nkitchen, and light-filled living room.\nWith 2,570 square feet, charming outdoor spaces, 1 car\ngarage parking, and ample storage, this home balances\nwhimsy and convenience. A rare opportunity to own a piece\nof San Francisco history with a multitude of possibilities."
  },
